{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon Bodega Simulator is a short simulation game where you run a small shop in the aforementioned dungeon while growing crops, raising pet dungeon slimes, serving customers, and brewing potions. Choose how to expand and upgrade your bodega while getting to know the locals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Elm Myrkwater, a recently laid off adventurer who was gifted the bodega by a distant uncle and trying to turn this cold prison into a welcoming supply spot for adventurers and locals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458180/extras/7966868b31f7aaaa70efa56886676d47.avif?t=1773520007\" alt=\"Game Features\" width=1400 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow crops and process them into items for adventurers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell items to friendly customers and dungeon dwellers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brew potions and turn your crops into sought after elixirs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge expensive weapons and tools to sell.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day/night cycle, spend as much time as you like setting up your shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get dungeon slimes you can keep as pets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend your regulars and solve puzzles in a dungeon mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro Style graphics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458180/extras/bb88336c300502de78de9d7fcc040e04.poster.avif?t=1773520007\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458180/extras/bb88336c300502de78de9d7fcc040e04.webm?t=1773520007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458180/extras/bb88336c300502de78de9d7fcc040e04.mp4?t=1773520007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll be able to enjoy 8+ different unique crop types that you can turn into a variety of potions and products for your customers.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458180/extras/fe18b51db0d02fa9c34bcbf9a512bab2.poster.avif?t=1773520007\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458180/extras/fe18b51db0d02fa9c34bcbf9a512bab2.webm?t=1773520007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458180/extras/fe18b51db0d02fa9c34bcbf9a512bab2.mp4?t=1773520007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dungeon is full of creatures both nice and gnarly, and your customers will need some assistance! Brew different potions and sell them for a significant amount of gold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458180/extras/d8536133dc0cedf21ad7445d86af422c.poster.avif?t=1773520007\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458180/extras/d8536133dc0cedf21ad7445d86af422c.webm?t=1773520007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458180/extras/d8536133dc0cedf21ad7445d86af422c.mp4?t=1773520007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know your regulars, learn about the dungeon, and take care of your customers needs while you run your shop. In the full release you'll be able to unlock new types of customers as you improve and upgrade your bodega.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458180/extras/7b3e6ed8a6cb71802a727b0852997238.poster.avif?t=1773520007\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458180/extras/7b3e6ed8a6cb71802a727b0852997238.webm?t=1773520007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458180/extras/7b3e6ed8a6cb71802a727b0852997238.mp4?t=1773520007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dungeon may be home to many dangerous creatures, but your pet slimes are exceptionally sweet! These lil guys also serve a valuable purpose, turning unused items into potions. Slimes are not picky eaters but are quite hungry!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458180/extras/b502ebe496b89c62ce5eba4991c9439f.poster.avif?t=1773520007\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458180/extras/b502ebe496b89c62ce5eba4991c9439f.webm?t=1773520007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458180/extras/b502ebe496b89c62ce5eba4991c9439f.mp4?t=1773520007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We couldn't forget the most important part about running a bodega, petting the bodega cat!\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3458180?t=1773520007","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3458180?t=1773520007","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458180/ef66f111148bde94ca69a43ba44748beafc34eae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773520007","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458180/ef66f111148bde94ca69a43ba44748beafc34eae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773520007","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4035470,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon Bodega Simulator is a short simulation game where you run a small shop in the aforementioned dungeon while growing crops, raising pet dungeon slimes, serving customers, and brewing potions. Choose how to expand and upgrade your bodega while getting to know the locals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Elm Myrkwater, a recently laid off adventurer who was gifted the bodega by a distant uncle and trying to turn this cold prison into a welcoming supply spot for adventurers and locals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458180/extras/7966868b31f7aaaa70efa56886676d47.avif?t=1773520007\" alt=\"Game Features\" width=1400 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow crops and process them into items for adventurers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell items to friendly customers and dungeon dwellers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brew potions and turn your crops into sought after elixirs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge expensive weapons and tools to sell.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day/night cycle, spend as much time as you like setting up your shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get dungeon slimes you can keep as pets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend your regulars and solve puzzles in a dungeon mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro Style graphics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458180/extras/bb88336c300502de78de9d7fcc040e04.poster.avif?t=1773520007\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458180/extras/bb88336c300502de78de9d7fcc040e04.webm?t=1773520007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458180/extras/bb88336c300502de78de9d7fcc040e04.mp4?t=1773520007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll be able to enjoy 8+ different unique crop types that you can turn into a variety of potions and products for your customers.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset